 "title": "Energy | 24-Hour Fuel Stations Near You - Key Cooperative",
 "text": "Energy | 24-Hour Fuel Stations Near You - Key Cooperative\nMain\nUtilities\nAbout\nWho We Are\nOur Leaders\nValue Of A Co-Op\nCommunity Involvement\nHistory Timeline\nCustomer Resources\nAgronomy\nSeed\nAgronomy Services\nCrop Nutrition\nCrop Protection\nCENTROL Precision Ag\nConservation\nAgronomy Team\nGrain\nCash Bids Futures\nCash Bids Sign Up\nCrop Insurance\nDiscount Schedules & Policies\nGrain Marketing Options\nGrain Team\nEnergy\nPropane\nRefined Fuels\nAutomated Fuel Delivery\nLube, Oil & Grease\n24 Hour Fuel Stations\nMember Discount\nEnergy Team\nFeed\nBeef\nDairy\nEquine\nPet Food\nPoultry\nSheep & Goat\nShow Feeds\nSwine\nPrograms\nFeed Team\nRetail\nLumber & Construction\nEnergy & Retail Center\nContact Us\nCareers\nNews\nCustomer Account\nContact Us\nCareers\nNews\nCustomer Account\n24 - Hour Fuel Stations\nYour fuel choice matters\nKey Cooperative 24 - hour fuel stations\nWhen you choose to purchase fuel from Key Cooperative, you can rest assured that you’re doing business with a local company, not a major chain. As your local cooperative, we are community-focused and make it a priority to be good neighbors by investing in hometown projects and student scholarships.\nEvery time you fill up at your local Key Fuel Station, you’re supporting area farmers and your community. Thank you!\nContact Energy\nLocally-owned, community focused and right down the road\nHere for You\nOur pumps are open to all, 24-hours a day! Fixed price contracts available with 1,000 gallon minimum.\nLocally Owned\nWe know what’s in our fuel and we stand behind the quality of each product.\nNo Account Required\nWe accept all major credit cards and you don’t have to have an account or membership to fill your tank!\nFuel that Supports Farmers\nEvery time you fill up at your local Key Cooperative Fuel Station, you’re supporting area farmers and your community.\nOur 24 - hour fueling stations help keep rural communities humming\nUse your Key fuel card, credit or debit card to fill your tank with gasoline, diesel or ethanol blends—anytime of the day or night—365 days a year.\nKey's fuel stations are conveniently located in these 9 communities: Ames, Gilbert, Grinnell, Nevada, New Sharon, Newton, Roland, Story City & Sully.\nClick pins for more information on each fueling station.\nSign Up for a Fuel Card\nView all Energy Locations\n+ −\nLeaflet | © OpenStreetMap contributors\nPremium Gasoline, Diesel and Ethanol\nCenex® Premium Diesel comes with a more complete additive package for a more complete burn to optimize performance in all engines. The Cenex name has been an industry leader in premium fuels and after more than 50 years of keeping up with the latest advances in diesel technology, we’re proud to offer their line of on-road and off-road products to our customers.\nFUEL STATIONS\nFuel Brands We Carry:\nEnjoy Savings at the Pump\nwith our fuel card discount\nGet a Key Cooperative fuel card and automatically save $.06 cents per gallon every time you fill up at one of Key's 24-Hour Fuel Stations.\nSimply start an account with us and pass our credit approval process. Multiple cards can be provided so each member of your family can enjoy the savings.\nOur 24-Hour Fuel Stations offer premium fuels from Cenex® including: Unleaded, Super Unleaded (10% ethanol blend), Unleaded 88 and Premium Cenex® Roadmaster XL.\nKey's fuel stations are conveniently located in these 9 communities: Ames, Gilbert, Grinnell, Nevada, New Sharon, Newton, Roland, Story City & Sully.\nInterested in saving up to $.06 per gallon on your fuel? Fill out the form and we'll be in touch!\nYour Name*\nStreet Address*\nCity*\nState*\nZip Code*\nEmail Address*\nPhone Number*\nAlready have an account with Key? Enter your account number.\nAccount* #\nSecurity code\nABOUT\nAGRONOMY\nGRAIN\nENERGY\nFEED\nRETAIL\nCONTACT US\nCAREERS\nNEWS\nCUSTOMER ACCOUNT\nSTAFF ONLY\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 Key Cooperative - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 